# Ancient Adamantoise's ward {3} (CR 702.21a): Bot2's first Swords to Plowshares at it is countered when Bot2 declines to
# pay {3}; the second, paid for, exiles it, and Bot1 gains 8 life. Exiled is not dying, so no Treasures (CR 700.4). With the
# Adamantoise gone its redirection no longer applies (CR 611.3a, 614.1a): Bot2's Lightning Bolt at Bot1 is dealt to Bot1.

